WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.738
- [murmuring indistinctly]
[baby cooing]

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.973
- HEY, WATCH WHERE THE [bleep]
YOU GOING.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.074
- OH, MY GOSH,
I'M SO SORRY.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.542
- OH.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.411
[baby giggles]

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:13.546
I DIDN'T SEE YOU HAD
A BABY THERE, MAN.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.914
I'M SORRY. I AIN'T TRYING
TO FIGHT NOBODY WITH A BABY.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.850
[baby gurgles]

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.886
- YEAH, H-HELL YEAH,
YOU WON'T.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.054
- PFFT.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:24.557
- [clears throat]

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.526
- LUCKY MOTHER[bleep].

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.428
- OH, YEAH?

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:29.629
WELL, YOU'RE LUCKY
I'M CARRYING THIS BABY.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.564
WHAT'S UP WITH THAT?

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.533
- LOOK, MAN, YOU NEED
TO MOVE ON, ALL RIGHT?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.835
I ALREADY TOLD YOU
I'M NOT GONNA FIGHT YOU.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.304
- HUH.
THAT'S WHAT I THOUGHT, PUNK.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:40.040
- PSH.
- YOU WANNA GO?

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.341
'CAUSE WE CAN GO
RIGHT NOW, DOG.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.243
WHAT'S GOIN' ON, BROTHER?

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.145
- MAN, WHAT THE HELL
ARE YOU DOING, MAN?

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:46.946
- WHAT, WHAT, WHAT?
YOU TR--WHAT, WHAT?

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.548
TRYIN' TO BO--
I CAN BOB AND WEAVE IT.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.316
- WHAT?
- YOU BITCH-ASS,

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.918
PUNK-ASS MOTHER[bleep],
LET'S GO.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.920
COME ON, MAN.
COME ON.

00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.822
NO, NO, DON'T LOOK AT YOUR BOYS.
LOOK AT ME, MAN.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:56.756
[high-pitched voice]
DON'T LOOK AT YOUR B--

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.491
OW.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.193
OH, OKAY,
YOU THINK YOU HARD.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.095
ALL RIGHT,
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.163
I'MA SHOW YOU WHAT TIME IT IS
RIGHT NOW.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:04.998
OKAY? SLAP ME.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:07.033
I'M JUST--RIGHT?
HOW 'BOUT THIS, HUH?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.902
NOW WHAT YOU GONNA DO, HUH?
NOW WHAT YOU GONNA DO?

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.670
YOU READY?
'CAUSE WE CAN DO IT RIGHT NOW.

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:12.272
'CAUSE I COULD TAKE YOU OUT,
MAN.

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:13.206
YOU'RE NOTHING--
[whack]

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.207
OW!

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.708
OH! OOF.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.843
[wincing]
OKAY.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.911
OH, IT'S ON NOW.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.479
THAT'S--YEP.

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:20.713
YOU DEAD.
YOU DEAD.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.948
[dramatic action music]

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:22.916
EXCUSE ME, I NEED THIS.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:23.883
YEAH.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.085
♪ ♪

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:26.686
<i> NECESITO UN BEBE.</i>

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.654
- [gasps]
-<i> GRACIAS.</i>

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:34.094
♪ ♪

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.161
LISTEN.
[babies crying]

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:36.296
- WHAT THE--

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.564
- WHAT NOW, MAN?

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.332
WHAT NOW?

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:40.600
LET'S GO.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.035
- YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:44.104
IT'S NOT EVEN WORTH IT, MAN.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.972
- AHH, HA HA.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.440
THAT'S WHAT I THOUGHT!

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.775
SO KEEP WALKING!

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.777
OH. OKAY, THAT'S VOMIT.

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:52.412
THAT IS VOMIT.
[baby burps]

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.579
OH, DEAR.

